<title>USA: Hoffman-La Roche says to market Hepatitis C drug.</title>
<headline>Hoffman-La Roche says to market Hepatitis C drug.</headline>
<dateline>NUTLEY, N.J. 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hoffmann-La Roche Inc, a unit of Roche Holding Ltd, said on Monday that it has received U.S. marketing clearance today for the treatment of chronic hepatitis C with its product, Roferon-A.</p>
<p>Hoffmann-La Roche and Gilead Sciences Inc will co-promote Roferon-A for the treatment of chronic hepatitis C.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
